<title>USA: Industrial Scientific to sell Monitor Group.</title>
<headline>Industrial Scientific to sell Monitor Group.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Scientific Corp said Friday it has signed a letter of intent to sell its Monitor Group business unit to L.B. Foster Co.</p>
<p>Based in Cheswick, Pa., Monitor Group is a developer of portable mass spectrometers that was acquired by Industrial Scientific in June 1995.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed in April.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed in the announcement.</p>
</text>
